[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 1: Use the given condition $\overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This tells us that the segment from the incenter $I$ to the vertex $A$ is **perpendicular** to the segment from the circumcenter $O$ to the incenter $I$. That is:
