[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 3: Use the condition $IA \perp OI$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This is a key geometric condition. In triangle geometry, the incenter $I$ and circumcenter $O$ are not generally aligned in a way that makes $\overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI}$, unless the triangle has a specific configuration.
