[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 4: Use vector or coordinate geometry to find the relationship
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Alternatively, we can use vector geometry or coordinate geometry to express the positions of $I$ and $O$, and then use the condition that $\vec{IA} \cdot \vec{OI} = 0$ (since they are perpendicular).
