[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 8: Use the formula for the area of the triangle
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We also know:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
