[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 2: Simplify the expression
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We want $ \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} $ to be an integer.
