[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 6: Solve $ 2 - x = \sqrt{\frac{x}{34}} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s square both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m (2 - x)^2 = \frac{x}{34}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 4 - 4x + x^2 = \frac{x}{34}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Multiply both sides by 34 to eliminate the fraction:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 136 - 136x + 34x^2 = x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 34x^2 - 137x + 136 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Solve the quadratic:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x = \frac{137 \pm \sqrt{137^2 - 4 \cdot 34 \cdot 136}}{2 \cdot 34}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Compute discriminant:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m D = 137^2 - 4 \cdot 34 \cdot 136 = 18769 - 18448 = 321
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x = \frac{137 \pm \sqrt{321}}{68}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We only consider the **positive** root in the interval $ [1, 2) $, since the other root may be outside this interval.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s compute the approximate value of $ \sqrt{321} \approx 17.916 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x_1 = \frac{137 + 17.916}{68} \approx \frac{154.916}{68} \approx 2.27
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This is **outside** the interval $ [1, 2) $, so discard.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x_2 = \frac{137 - 17.916}{68} \approx \frac{119.084}{68} \approx 1.75
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This is in $ [1, 2) $, so **valid**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So, one solution is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x = \frac{137 - \sqrt{321}}{68}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Then the corresponding $ y $-coordinate is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m y = \sqrt{\frac{x}{34}} = \sqrt{ \frac{137 - \sqrt{321}}{68 \cdot 34} } = \sqrt{ \frac{137 - \sqrt{321}}{2312} }
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
