[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s square the sum:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m (A + B)^2 = C + D + 2\sqrt{CD}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m C + D = \frac{137 - \sqrt{321} + 137 + \sqrt{321}}{2312} = \frac{274}{2312} = \frac{137}{1156}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
