[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 3: Use the Rhombus Properties
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m In a rhombus, all sides are equal in length. So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m AB = BC = CD = DA
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We can compute the lengths of the sides using the distance formula.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s compute the length of side $AB$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m AB = \sqrt{(a - c)^2 + (b - d)^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Similarly, the length of side $BC$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m BC = \sqrt{(c + a)^2 + (d + b)^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m For $AB = BC$, we must have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m (a - c)^2 + (b - d)^2 = (a + c)^2 + (b + d)^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Expanding both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m a^2 - 2ac + c^2 + b^2 - 2bd + d^2 = a^2 + 2ac + c^2 + b^2 + 2bd + d^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m -2ac - 2bd = 2ac + 2bd \Rightarrow -4ac - 4bd = 0 \Rightarrow ac + bd = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ac + bd = 0 \quad \text{(3)}
