[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 3: Use the Properties of the Rhombus
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m In a rhombus, the diagonals are **perpendicular** and bisect each other.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So the diagonals $AC$ and $BD$ are perpendicular.
