[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the geometry
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - A **rhombus** has diagonals that **bisect each other at right angles** (in a **square**, they are perpendicular and equal), but in a **rhombus**, the diagonals are **not necessarily equal**.
