[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We can simplify this using modular arithmetic.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 3: Use modular reduction
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We want to find when $ 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s divide $ 9b + 7 $ by $ b + 7 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
