[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - We are to find the time it takes her to walk at **$ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h**, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations based on the first scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m When she walks at speed $ s $ km/h, the time taken is 4 hours, including $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Convert 4 hours to minutes:  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $ 4 \text{ hours} = 240 \text{ minutes} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let the time spent walking be $ t_w $ minutes. Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m t_w + t = 240 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m The distance is 9 km, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{9}{s} = \frac{t_w}{60} \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m From (1), $ t_w = 240 - t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Substitute into (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{9}{s} = \frac{240 - t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Multiply both sides by 60:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s} = 240 - t \quad \text{(3)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 2: Set up equations based on the second scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m When she walks at speed $ s + 2 $ km/h, the total time is 2 hours and 24 minutes, which is 2.4 hours = 144 minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m t_w' + t = 144 \quad \text{(4)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m The distance is still 9 km, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = \frac{t_w'}{60} \quad \text{(5)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m From (4), $ t_w' = 144 - t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Substitute into (5):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = \frac{144 - t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Multiply both sides by 60:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s + 2} = 144 - t \quad \text{(6)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 3: Now we have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m From (3):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s} = 240 - t \quad \text{(3)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m From (6):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s + 2} = 144 - t \quad \text{(6)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s subtract (6) from (3):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s} - \frac{540}{s + 2} = (240 - t) - (144 - t)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Simplify the right-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 240 - t - 144 + t = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s} - \frac{540}{s + 2} = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Factor out 540:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 540 \left( \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} \right) = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Compute the difference:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} = \frac{(s + 2) - s}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{2}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 540 \cdot \frac{2}{s(s + 2)} = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{1080}{s(s + 2)} = 96
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Multiply both sides by $ s(s + 2) $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 1080 = 96s(s + 2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Divide both sides by 24:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 45 = 4s(s + 2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Expand the right-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 45 = 4s^2 + 8s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Bring all terms to one side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 4s^2 + 8s - 45 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Solve this quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Use the quadratic formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m s = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{8^2 - 4 \cdot 4 \cdot (-45)}}{2 \cdot 4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{64 + 720}}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m = \frac{-8 \pm \sqrt{764}}{8}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \sqrt{764} = \sqrt{4 \cdot 191} = 2\sqrt{191}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m s = \frac{-8 \pm 2\sqrt{191}}{8} = \frac{-4 \pm \sqrt{191}}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Since speed cannot be negative, we take the positive root:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m s = \frac{-4 + \sqrt{191}}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This is a bit messy, but we can now use the original equations to find $ t $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s go back to equation (3):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{s} = 240 - t
