[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Now check equation (6):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{6 + 2} = \frac{540}{8} = 67.5 = 144 - t \Rightarrow t = 76.5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Not equal. So $ s = 6 $ is not the solution.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Try $ s = 5 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
