[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Check equation (6):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{540}{5 + 2} = \frac{540}{7} \approx 77.14 = 144 - t \Rightarrow t \approx 66.86
