[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m = d^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So this is an identity, and we can’t find a minimum value of $d^2$ from this.
