[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 6: Use Symmetry and Parametrize the Hyperbola
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s parametrize the hyperbola:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{x^2}{20} - \frac{y^2}{24} = 1
