[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We can use the standard parametrization for hyperbola:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x = \sqrt{20} \sec \theta, \quad y = \sqrt{24} \tan \theta
