[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $A = (\sqrt{20} \sec \theta, \sqrt{24} \tan \theta)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $B = (\sqrt{20} \sec \phi, \sqrt{24} \tan \phi)$
