[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m These are perpendicular, and the origin is the midpoint.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Now, check if these points lie on the hyperbola:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1 \quad \text{(1)}
