[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Subtract (1) and (2):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \left( \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} \right) - \left( \frac{b^2}{20} - \frac{a^2}{24} \right) = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} - \frac{b^2}{20} + \frac{a^2}{24} = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{a^2}{20} + \frac{a^2}{24} - \frac{b^2}{24} - \frac{b^2}{20} = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} + \frac{a^2}{24} = \frac{b^2}{24} + \frac{b^2}{20}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{3a^2 + a^2}{60} = \frac{3b^2 + b^2}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \Rightarrow 4a^2 = 4b^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \Rightarrow a = \pm b
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So, the only solution is $a = b$, and then from (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{a^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow \frac{a^2}{60} = 1 \Rightarrow a^2 = 60
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So $a = \sqrt{60}$, and $b = \sqrt{60}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Now, compute $BD^2$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m BD = \sqrt{(2b)^2 + (2a)^2} = \sqrt{4b^2 + 4a^2} = \sqrt{4(a^2 + b^2)} = 2\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}
