[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Where $s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}$, and $a = BC$, $b = AC$, $c = AB$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m But we are not given the sides, so we need to find $AB \cdot AC$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
