[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We also know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m IA = \sqrt{r^2 + (s - a)^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m But we are told that $IA \perp OI$, and we have the relation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m OI^2 = R(R - 2r) = 13 \cdot 1 = 13
