[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 1: Simplify the general term
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s look at the general term of the product:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
