[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We can use the change of base formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \log_a b = \frac{\log_c b}{\log_c a}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \log_k (5^{k^2 - 1}) = \frac{\log_5 (5^{k^2 - 1})}{\log_5 k} = \frac{k^2 - 1}{\log_5 k}
