[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Similarly,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \log_{k+1} (5^{k^2 - 4}) = \frac{\log_5 (5^{k^2 - 4})}{\log_5 (k+1)} = \frac{k^2 - 4}{\log_5 (k+1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So the general term becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{\frac{k^2 - 1}{\log_5 k}}{\frac{k^2 - 4}{\log_5 (k+1)}} = \frac{(k^2 - 1) \log_5 (k+1)}{(k^2 - 4) \log_5 k}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So the entire product becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \prod_{k=4}^{63} \frac{(k^2 - 1) \log_5 (k+1)}{(k^2 - 4) \log_5 k}
