[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 1: Interpret the numbers in base $ b $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ represents:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
