[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Similarly, the number $ 97_b $ represents:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We are told that $ 17_b $ divides $ 97_b $, i.e.,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 2: Use the divisibility condition
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We are given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This means that $ b + 7 $ divides $ 9b + 7 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
