[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 1: Convert the numbers from base $ b $ to base 10
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
