[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Now, subtract 7 from each:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 1 - 7 = -6 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 2 - 7 = -5 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 4 - 7 = -3 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 7 - 7 = 0 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 8 - 7 = 1 $ → valid, $ b = 1 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 14 - 7 = 7 $ → valid, $ b = 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 28 - 7 = 21 $ → valid, $ b = 21 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ 56 - 7 = 49 $ → valid, $ b = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So the valid values of $ b $ are:
