[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let the vertices of the rhombus be:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $A = (-a, 0)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $C = (a, 0)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $B = (0, b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $D = (0, -b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So the rhombus is symmetric with respect to the origin, and the diagonals are $AC = 2a$ and $BD = 2b$.
