[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Step 2: Use the Hyperbola Equation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Since all four points $A, B, C, D$ lie on the hyperbola, we can substitute each point into the hyperbola equation.
