[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m ### Correct Approach:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We are to find the **sum of the $ y $-coordinates** of the points where the parabola $ x = 34y^2 $ intersects the graph of $ f(x) $.
