[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s consider the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m f(x) = \pm \sqrt{\frac{x}{34}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m We solve this in each interval where $ f(x) $ is linear.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Let’s consider the interval $ [-1, 1) $, where $ f(x) = x $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m x = \pm \sqrt{\frac{x}{34}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
