[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Solving:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ x = \sqrt{\frac{x}{34}} \Rightarrow x^2 = \frac{x}{34} \Rightarrow x(34x - 1) = 0 \Rightarrow x = 0, \frac{1}{34} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m - $ x = -\sqrt{\frac{x}{34}} \Rightarrow x^2 = \frac{x}{34} \Rightarrow x(34x - 1) = 0 \Rightarrow x = 0, \frac{1}{34} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So in this interval, we get two points: $ (0, 0) $, $ \left( \frac{1}{34}, \frac{1}{34} \right) $, and $ \left( \frac{1}{34}, -\frac{1}{34} \right) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Now consider the interval $ [1, 3) $, where $ f(x) = 2 - x $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 2 - x = \pm \sqrt{\frac{x}{34}}
