[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m d^2 = \frac{6c^2}{5} - 24
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So, the constraint is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{\frac{6c^2}{5} - 24}{24} = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m Simplify the second term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{\frac{6c^2}{5} - 24}{24} = \frac{6c^2}{120} - \frac{24}{24} = \frac{c^2}{20} - 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{c^2}{20} - \left(\frac{c^2}{20} - 1\right) = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m This is always true, so the constraint is satisfied for all $c$ such that $d^2 = \frac{6c^2}{5} - 24 \ge 0$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So, we require:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m \frac{6c^2}{5} - 24 \ge 0 \Rightarrow c^2 \ge 20
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m So, the minimum value of $c^2$ is 20, and the minimum value of $BD^2$ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25285)[0m $$
